{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.signedWeightSum_conj_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.signedWeightSum_conj_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L141-L151","doc":"**The signed weighted sum is C-invariant** (derived, conditional):\n`Σ W·ε` is unchanged by flavor conjugation — the scalar face of the\ngenerator invariance, numerically cross-checked at q₀ by\n`computations/verify_c_color_swap.py`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.signedWeightSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.signedWeightSum","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L133-L139","doc":"The scalar shadow of the refined generator: the signed weighted sum\n`Σ_{c₁c₂} W_{c₁c₂}(F₁,F₂) · ε(c₁,c₂,F₁,F₂)` over the 9 color pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.refined_generator_data_conj_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.refined_generator_data_conj_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L116-L131","doc":"**The refined generator data is C-invariant** (derived, conditional): for\nevery color pair, both the weight and the chirality exponent are unchanged\nby conjugating the flavor content.  Since the color-weighted generator\n`σ^(F₁,F₂) = Σ_{c₁c₂} W_{c₁c₂}(F₁,F₂) · σ^{ε(c₁,c₂,F₁,F₂)}` depends on\n`(F₁, F₂)` only through the per-pair data `(W, ε)`, this is exactly the\nstatement that C leaves the canonical Hecke generator of every\ninter-nucleon arc invariant.  Derivation: class field (weights) composed\nwith the proved `chiralitySign_conj_invariant` (exponents). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap.weight_conj_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap.weight_conj_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L110-L110","doc":"The weight tensor is flavor-conjugation invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap.mk","kind":"ctor","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L108-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CFromColorFlavorSwap","kind":"class","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L100-L112","doc":"**CONJECTURE (§3b-cond class).**  D6 charge conjugation commutes with the\ncolor-tube weight tensor: `W_{c₁c₂}(F̄₁, F̄₂) = W_{c₁c₂}(F₁, F₂)` (the\nweights are flavor-conjugation invariant).  This is claim 1 of\n`conj:c-from-color-flavor-swap`'s \"conjectural content\" list; it is the\nonly claim that cannot be derived today, because the closed form of `W`\nis itself open.  Conditional on the upstream channel-assignment class;\nno global instance is provided. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:c-from-color-flavor-swap","label":"conj:c-from-color-flavor-swap","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/c-from-color-flavor-swap.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign_conj_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign_conj_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L89-L96","doc":"**The chirality sign ε commutes with C** (claim 2 of the block, proved\nsorry-free): `ε(c₁, c₂, F̄₁, F̄₂) = ε(c₁, c₂, F₁, F₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.flavorAt_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.flavorAt_conj","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L72-L76","doc":"Conjugation commutes with reading off the flavor at a sheet. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.conj_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.conj_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L66-L70","doc":"**C² = id** on nucleon color content (the involution claim, proved). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conj_proton_neutron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.conj_proton_neutron","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L61-L64","doc":"C maps the proton to the antiproton and the neutron to the antineutron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.antineutron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.antineutron","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L57-L59","doc":"Antineutron color content (ū, d̄, d̄). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.antiproton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.antiproton","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L53-L55","doc":"Antiproton color content (ū, ū, d̄). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.conj","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CFromColorFlavorSwap.lean#L47-L51","doc":"Charge conjugation on a nucleon's color-sheet content: flavor\nconjugation `u ↔ ū`, `d ↔ d̄` applied independently on each of the three\ncolor sheets. ","signatureChunk":0}]}